# Only what the image needs goes to Docker (2026-11-18). Without this file every rebuild sent the whole folder,
# data/ with both databases and their backups, .git, certs/ and .mkcert-ca/, to the Docker daemon: gigabytes of disk
# reads per release, and secrets that never belong near a build. Keep this an allow-list: everything out, then the four
# things the Dockerfile copies back in.
*
!Dockerfile
!entrypoint.sh
!server.js
!server/
!public/

# Downloads folders (docker-compose.yml)
music/
slskd-downloads/
usenet-complete/
